    "body": "I agree with the third. We should not trigger resize if we are already in fullscreen.\r\n\r\nThe first is only simple in concept. I think that would require impls to have an additional queue for that, but it doesn't make anything better for normal usecases. I'm against adding impl complexity like that without a good reason.",
